        "original_id": "d6b12620-b694-5800-805c-f4a7e8dbe3ae",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Matt Groening, Al Jean, Mike Reiss, Sam Simon, Rich Moore, Hank Azaria\n- Characters: Apu Nahasapeemapetilon, Manjula\n- Episodes: The Telltale Head, Eight Misbehavin'\n- Topics: voice acting, writing, directing, fertility drugs, octuplets, corporate sponsors, zoo exploitation\n\nFacts:\n- Matt Groening was born on February 15, 1954, and he is an American cartoonist, writer, producer, animator, and voice actor.\n- The episode \"The Telltale Head\" was written by Al Jean, Mike Reiss, Sam Simon, and Matt Groening, and it was directed by Rich Moore.\n- Apu Nahasapeemapetilon is voiced by Hank Azaria and first appeared in the episode \"The Telltale Head\".\n- In the episode \"Eight Misbehavin',\" Manjula gives birth to octuplets conceived with fertility drugs.\n- In the episode \"Eight Misbehavin',\" Apu and Manjula unintentionally allow a zookeeper to exploit their babies in exchange for help after corporate sponsors abandon them for a mother who gave birth to nonuplets.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
